
                    <html>
                    <head>
                        <meta charset="utf-8">
                        <style>
                            body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; padding: 20px; }
                            h1 { color: #1e293b; border-bottom: 2px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 10px; }
                            h2 { color: #334155; margin-top: 30px; }
                            table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
                            th, td { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
                            th { background-color: #f8fafc; font-weight: bold; width: 40%; }
                            .total td { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981; }
                        </style>
                    </head>
                    <body>
                        <h1>Kalkulacija / Ponudba: Ponudba</h1>
                        <table>
                            <tr><th>Številka ponudbe</th><td></td></tr>
